stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending
  Pending --> EligibleRead: Read active canonical property
  Pending --> UnavailableRead: Read inactive, missing, or other tenant property
  EligibleRead --> EligibleRead: Rename then read current canonical label
  EligibleRead --> UnavailableRead: Deactivate or hide then read
  EligibleRead --> Refused: Accept with stale cart version
  UnavailableRead --> Refused: Accept unavailable property
  EligibleRead --> PartiallyAccepted: Accept some choices with current version
  EligibleRead --> Accepted: Accept all choices with current version
  PartiallyAccepted --> UnavailableRead: Deactivate then read
  PartiallyAccepted --> Accepted: Accept remaining eligible choices
  PartiallyAccepted --> Dismissed: Keep current cart
  Pending --> Dismissed: Keep current cart
  Accepted --> Accepted: Replay identical receipt
  Refused --> Pending: Reload without cart mutation
